@base = http://localhost:10002/api/commerce

### 1. 加载初始业务数据（不清除工单）
POST {{base}}/demo/load

### 2. 演示身份
POST {{base}}/demo/identities

### 3. 小林有两笔杯子订单，返回 NEED_SELECTION
POST {{base}}/orders/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope":{"merchantId":"demo-merchant","shopId":"demo-shop-tb","customerId":"demo-customer-tb-1"},"productClue":"杯"}

### 4. 查询已选择订单的物流
POST {{base}}/logistics/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope":{"merchantId":"demo-merchant","shopId":"demo-shop-tb","customerId":"demo-customer-tb-1"},"orderId":"demo-order-tb-01"}

### 5. 同店其他顾客订单不得返回
POST {{base}}/orders/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope":{"merchantId":"demo-merchant","shopId":"demo-shop-tb","customerId":"demo-customer-tb-1"},"orderNumber":"TB202610120005"}

### 6. 未确认不得创建；将 false 改为 true 才可成功（HTTP 直接演示入口）
POST {{base}}/tickets/create
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope":{"merchantId":"demo-merchant","shopId":"demo-shop-dy","customerId":"demo-customer-dy-1"},"sessionId":"demo-session-dy-1","messageId":"customer-message-001","orderId":"demo-order-dy-01","ticketType":"RETURN_REQUEST","reason":"杯盖破损，申请退货","customerConfirmed":false}

### 7. 再次发送相同消息返回同一工单
POST {{base}}/tickets/create
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope":{"merchantId":"demo-merchant","shopId":"demo-shop-dy","customerId":"demo-customer-dy-1"},"sessionId":"demo-session-dy-1","messageId":"customer-message-001","orderId":"demo-order-dy-01","ticketType":"RETURN_REQUEST","reason":"杯盖破损，申请退货","customerConfirmed":true}

### 8. 按会话读取工单及处理历史
POST {{base}}/tickets/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope":{"merchantId":"demo-merchant","shopId":"demo-shop-dy","customerId":"demo-customer-dy-1"},"sessionId":"demo-session-dy-1"}

### 9. 替换 ticketId；之后可 expectedStatus=PROCESSING,status=COMPLETED
POST {{base}}/tickets/update
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantId":"demo-merchant","shopId":"demo-shop-dy","ticketId":"REPLACE_WITH_RETURNED_TICKET_ID","expectedStatus":"PENDING_REVIEW","status":"PROCESSING","note":"已联系顾客核实破损情况","operatorId":"demo-operator"}

### 10. 仅恢复 commerce 演示数据；阅读影响后将 false 改成 true
POST {{base}}/demo/restore
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmed":false}
